# GitHub Contributions — a contribution calendar (~19 weeks x 7 days of
# Animated.Views) in a full-screen PressableScale: a tap fills every square with
# its level colour via a staggered (45ms per diagonal) withDelay+withSpring wave
# (scale dip + interpolateColor), the next tap resets them with random delays.
# What this test covers: the fill wave, the reset wave, toggling again while the
# fill wave is still propagating (cancelAnimation + reset), several quick
# toggles in a row, a long hold on the card, taps outside the calendar card
# (the whole screen is the pressable), and a final settle.
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/github-contributions"
wait "label=\"Close\"" 45000
# Warm-up touch on the status bar: the first touch of a test can be lost while
# the XCTest runner attaches.
press 330 20
wait 500
wait "text" "Mon" 10000
wait 1000
press 201 437
wait 3500
press 201 437
wait 2500
# Fill, then reset while the wave is still running.
press 201 437
wait 400
press 201 437
wait 2500
# Quick toggles.
press 201 437 --count 5 --interval-ms 150
wait 3000
# Taps outside the card.
press 200 700
wait 2000
press 120 250
wait 2500
longpress 201 437 1500
wait 3000
wait "label=\"Close\"" 15000
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Close\""
wait 1500
